From 469a4c6a330ee425403d63b0c58c1740ecef6406 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:11:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Add partial column moves and fix game-over detection

- Implement Ctrl+Wheel, Up/Down keys to select specific cards within a stack for partial transfers instead of moving entire columns
- Add Shift+Click modifier to force full-column selection when needed
- Refactor legal move validation to use deep-cloned game states via `clone_game` to prevent state corruption from engine's shared `_bag` reference bug
- Update deadlock logic: treat moves resulting in "Game Over" as invalid actions, ensuring the game only ends when no valid non-terminal moves or row additions remain
- Introduce undo functionality (Z key/button) with serialization/deserialization of game state for safe move reversal
- Enhance UI feedback with visual indicators for selected card ranges, drag-and-drop ghosts, and merge flash animations
